WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.850
Red Duster.

00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.525
The communists have seized power.

00:00:04.525 --> 00:00:06.687
Supply routes cut.

00:00:06.687 --> 00:00:09.525
Death squads patrol the highways.

00:00:09.525 --> 00:00:12.537
You are alone in the Canadian wilderness.

00:00:12.537 --> 00:00:13.912
Hunt.

00:00:13.912 --> 00:00:15.437
Fish.

00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:17.200
Scavenge.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.075
Build weapons.

00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:20.825
Fight back.
